cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "sfps-llm-counterfactual-audit: reproducibility package of the UISRAEL V4 counterfactual audit"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a counterfactual audit of nominally associated
  cultural signals (surnames of Kichwa vs. Hispanic origin) in generative AI
  assistants for debt collection in Ecuador's Popular and Solidarity Financial
  Sector. Frozen V4 protocol configuration, aggregated final results, judge,
  statistical and LangFair outputs, human-validation aggregates, figures, and
  provenance documentation.
type: software
